for a.e. x ∈ [0, 1]. We further assume that ∥f ∥22 = ∥g∥22 = 1 and ⟨f, g⟩ = 0. Throughout, if the
limits of integration of an integral are not specified, then it should be taken to be equal to [0, 1]2 .
    In [12], the authors constructed an infinite family of graphs of order n with spectral sum 87 n − 2.
In light of Lemma 3.4, we see that
